{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19539","headline":"和裴司空答张秘书赠马诗 · 张贾","name":"和裴司空答张秘书赠马诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"阁下从容旧客卿，寄来骏马赏高情。\n任追烟景骑仍醉，知有文章倚便成。\n步步自怜春日影，萧萧犹起朔风声。\n须知上宰吹嘘意，送入天门上路行。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张贾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19539.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19539","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}